notes = "Original five-reel, five-row adjacent-ways video slot, 1280x720. Wins read left to right from reel 1, one symbol per reel in the same or a neighbouring row; 3, 4 or 5 reels pay and every distinct path is a way. Wild sevens that double every win they join, scatter free spins with expanding wilds and a multiplier climbing to x5, a Lucky 7 Pick bonus round, HOLD & SPIN (lucky coins lock and respin), the WHEEL OF 7S, the 7 STRIKE random wild storm, a card gamble, and four jackpots won from the reels and scaled to the bet: JACKPOT clusters of 5/6/7+ pay 5x, 40x and 200x the bet, five ULTIMATE symbols touching pay 100,000x. A tenth of every bet feeds them. Bet 10 to 100,000 a spin. Return 93.9% at every bet, verified by the Monte-Carlo and exact enumeration in src/sim.c. All artwork is generated procedurally by the core at load."
